Description: terminal-first chat and prompt tool for language models
 sparkle is a terminal-first chat and prompt tool for language models, with a
 full-screen chat interface and a pipe-friendly command line. It talks to any
 OpenAI-compatible server, local or remote, and keeps conversations in a local
 SQLite history.
